codex
The corrected sheet passes the quadrature checks to about 70 digits and reproduces the implemented zeta constants. At \(x=13,N=60\), 11a1’s first recovered zero is \(6.36302347\), about \(4.10\times10^{-4}\) from PARI’s value.

For 37a1, the odd block has the lower minimum at all three tested windows, so the paper’s even-simple hypothesis fails there. I’m checking a larger 11a1 window and rank-two 389a1 to see how much of this behavior depends on parity.
