    77	/* ---- MVP-3 (2026-09-18): the general explicit-formula data model and elliptic curves over Q ----
    78	 * Plan: notes/zeta-spectral-triples/ellcurve/plan.md (formula sheet D1-D6 as corrected in
    79	 * astra-review.md, "Formula sheet for the workers"); parent data model: notes/zeta-spectral-triples/
