- Quadrature and zeta regression checks agree to roughly 70 digits.
- 11a1’s first-zero error reaches \(2.13\times10^{-9}\) at \(x=30,N=120\).
- 37a1 has an odd minimum at all three tested windows; 389a1 also fails even-simple at \(x=13\).
- Under even-simple, an exact central zero is impossible.

The report includes the correction ledger and revised acceptance criteria. Results are preliminary numerics, not interval certificates. `plan.md` was not modified.
